{% if required_node %}
{{ node }} is a MISPLACED required identity, not a disposable extra block.
The template requires {{ required_node }} under {{ parent }}. Move the existing
node to that parent with the required tag, retaining its text, tail and required
descendants in translation order. Do not delete it or create a second copy.
{% elif block %}
Unexpected block identity {{ node }} has no source output position. Move any
genuine translated content and required descendants into the appropriate existing
required blocks, preserving reading order and resource boundaries; then remove
only this surplus wrapper. Do not discard translation to repair structure.
{% else %}
Unexpected inline identity {{ node }} is not in the source template. If this is
a required anonymous formatting slot, remove the invented ID while retaining
that slot. If it is a surplus formatting wrapper, UNWRAP it while keeping its
text, tail and required descendants in place. Never delete translation merely
to remove a wrapper or ID. Correct any separately reported text difference too.
{% endif %}
